  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.027" end="00:05.542" ttm:agent="v1">[Intro]</p>
      <p begin="00:05.542" end="00:13.542" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh)</p>
      <p begin="00:20.603" end="00:23.615" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Like a telescope, we lookin' at the stars)</p>
      <p begin="00:23.615" end="00:27.153" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(She's so damn fine, and I'm so high, and who you are?)</p>
      <p begin="00:27.153" end="00:31.483" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(She's so damn bad, I done bought her Audemars, oh)</p>
      <p begin="00:31.483" end="00:32.996" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Uml, what the f*ck?)</p>
      <p begin="00:32.996" end="00:34.496" ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p>
      <p begin="00:33.490" end="00:35.246" ttm:agent="v1">The bigger the bag, the better the bitches</p>
      <p begin="00:35.246" end="00:37.026" ttm:agent="v1">I know they cooking, we put down the switches</p>
      <p begin="00:37.026" end="00:38.707" ttm:agent="v1">I bought new wood, she been smoking on Swishers</p>
      <p begin="00:38.707" end="00:40.714" ttm:agent="v1">The switches been running, the opps been pissing</p>
      <p begin="00:40.714" end="00:42.495" ttm:agent="v1">F*ck on a ho, do you get hurt to do dishes?</p>
      <p begin="00:42.495" end="00:44.252" ttm:agent="v1">I won't be smiling, I don't do pictures</p>
      <p begin="00:44.252" end="00:46.008" ttm:agent="v1">I don't do hugs, I don't do kisses</p>
      <p begin="00:46.008" end="00:47.763" ttm:agent="v1">F*ck no ho, I don't want no kids</p>
      <p begin="00:47.763" end="00:49.514" ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p>
      <p begin="00:49.514" end="00:53.177" ttm:agent="v1">Like a telescope, we lookin' at the stars</p>
      <p begin="00:53.177" end="00:56.693" ttm:agent="v1">She's so damn fine, and I'm so high, and who you are?</p>
      <p begin="00:56.693" end="01:01.968" ttm:agent="v1">She's so damn bad, I done bought her Audemars, oh</p>
      <p begin="01:01.968" end="01:03.468" ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p>
      <p begin="01:02.715" end="01:04.472" ttm:agent="v1">If it's double the money, it's double the size</p>
      <p begin="01:04.472" end="01:06.480" ttm:agent="v1">Facts for them bitches that f*ck for the night</p>
      <p begin="01:06.480" end="01:08.237" ttm:agent="v1">Double O Cactus just call us a night</p>
      <p begin="01:08.237" end="01:10.991" ttm:agent="v1">She told me she f*ck me, no matter the size</p>
      <p begin="01:10.991" end="01:16.047" ttm:agent="v1">Givin' up keys, we givin' up, please, sip my drink</p>
      <p begin="01:16.047" end="01:17.832" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Boy, I got your b**** all on her knees (Ah, yeah, schyeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:17.832" end="01:19.332" ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 3]</p>
      <p begin="01:18.582" end="01:22.471" ttm:agent="v1">They know I'm a big boss, got a big boss in this b****</p>
      <p begin="01:22.471" end="01:26.235" ttm:agent="v1">They know I'm a big talker, had my bit, buddy, it ain't shit</p>
      <p begin="01:26.235" end="01:29.499" ttm:agent="v1">No one taught me b****, RIP, the b**** may die</p>
      <p begin="01:29.499" end="01:33.263" ttm:agent="v1">Turn the light on, I'm outside,b**** , are the lights off or you inside?</p>
      <p begin="01:33.263" end="01:36.779" ttm:agent="v1">Been taking these drugs for fun, lil' b**** been putting X on her tounge</p>
      <p begin="01:36.779" end="01:41.093" ttm:agent="v1">B**** been taking the rum, b****, I'm bringin' my motherf*ckin' gun</p>
      <p begin="01:41.093" end="01:43.099" ttm:agent="v1">If your lights are off, I'm outside</p>
      <p begin="01:43.099" end="01:44.856" ttm:agent="v1">If your lights are off, I'm outside</p>
      <p begin="01:44.856" end="01:47.871" ttm:agent="v1">Had the lights off, I'm outside</p>
      <p begin="01:47.871" end="01:49.371" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, oh, oh</p>
      <p begin="01:48.430" end="01:49.930" ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p>
      <p begin="01:48.738" end="01:51.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Like a telescope, we lookin' at the stars)</p>
      <p begin="01:51.970" end="01:55.731" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(She's so damn fine, and I'm so high, and who you are?)</p>
      <p begin="01:55.731" end="02:00.048" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(She's so damn bad, I done bought her Audemars, oh)</p>
      <p begin="02:00.048" end="02:01.548" ttm:agent="v1">[Outro]</p>
      <p begin="02:00.801" end="02:04.801" ttm:agent="v1">Uml, what the f*ck?</p>
    </div>
